{"lesson_uid":"L0155","_provenance":{"generator":"backend/scripts/generate_lesson_zhuyin.py","reading_authority":"frontend/src/components/zhuyin/polyphonicProcessor.ts（跑，非移植）","source_font":"frontend/public/fonts/BpmfZihiSerif-Regular.ttf","font_sha256_16":"fc25a90d27699ec4","poyin_db_sha256_16":"2d4d4c9f1d0ec1a6","notation":"pypinyin BopomofoConverter（與 font_readings.json 同一個轉換器）","stats":{"texts":292,"chars":7053,"poly_positions":1650,"he_adjudicated":0,"xiang_adjudicated":3,"manual_corrections":0}},"texts":[{"section":"classical_text","slug":"7x9wp","idx":null,"text":"桓公曰：「吾欲下魯梁.，何行.而可？」管子對曰：「魯梁之民.俗為綈，公服綈，令左右.服之，民從.而服之，公因令.齊勿敢為，必仰於魯梁，則是魯梁釋其農事.而作綈矣。」桓公曰：「諾。」","n":90,"ssz":"....................1....................................................................."},{"section":"classical_text","slug":"7x9wp","idx":null,"text":"管子告魯梁之賈人曰：「子為我致綈.千匹，賜子.金三百斤，十至.而金三千斤，則是魯梁不賦於民.而財用足也。」魯梁之君.聞之，則教其民.為綈。十三月，魯梁郭中之民，道路.揚塵，車轂.連伍而行。管子對公曰：「公宜改.服帛，率民.去綈，毋與魯梁通使。」公曰：「諾。」","n":129,"ssz":".1.........11........1...................1.....................................................1................................."},{"section":"classical_text","slug":"7x9wp","idx":null,"text":"後十月，魯梁之民，餓餒相及，魯梁之君，即令其民.去綈.修農穀，不可以.三月而得，魯梁之人，糴十百，齊糶十錢。二十四月，魯梁之民.歸齊者十分之六，三年，魯梁之君.請服。","n":83,"ssz":"...........1..........................1............................................"},{"section":"modern_translation","slug":"44qjt","idx":null,"text":"齊桓公說：「我想拿下魯國和梁國，怎麼做才可以？」管仲回答：「魯國和梁國的人民習慣織『綈』來穿。主公可以帶頭穿綈做的衣服，並命令身邊的人穿，如此，人民也會跟著穿。接著，您再下令禁止齊國人織綈；主公的命令齊國人民不敢不聽，勢必仰賴魯、梁兩國，向他們購買綈。如此，魯、梁兩國的人民就會放下農活，爭相去織綈了。」齊桓公說：「好。」","n":161,"ssz":"............1...................1................................................................................................................1..............."},{"section":"modern_translation","slug":"44qjt","idx":null,"text":"管仲對魯國和梁國的商人說：「你們幫我運來一千匹綈，我就賞賜你們三百斤金；送到十倍的數量，就賞賜三千斤金。這樣，魯、梁兩國不用向人民課稅，國庫財政也能充足。」魯國和梁國的國君聽說這件事，果然大力號召、教導他們的人民去織綈。","n":110,"ssz":".....1......................................................1...................1............................."},{"section":"modern_translation","slug":"44qjt","idx":null,"text":"十三個月後，兩國城裡的人民為了織綈、運綈，忙得路上都塵土飛揚，運綈的車一輛接一輛。管仲於是對齊桓公說：「主公現在可以改穿一般的絲織品，帶領人民不再穿綈，也不要與魯、梁兩國有任何外交往來。」齊桓公說：「好。」","n":103,"ssz":"..1..........1........1............1..1.....................2..........1.....1........................."},{"section":"modern_translation","slug":"44qjt","idx":null,"text":"又過了十個月，此時，兩國的人民因為缺糧，挨餓的人一個接一個。魯、梁兩國的國君驚覺不妙，立刻命令人民停止織綈、趕快回去務農種糧，但是糧食作物根本不可能在三個月內收成。結果，魯梁的人民買十升糧食要花上千錢，而齊國賣十升糧的成本卻只要十錢。","n":117,"ssz":"....1...........1........1..1...........1...................................1........................................"},{"section":"modern_translation","slug":"44qjt","idx":null,"text":"兩年後，魯梁的人民為了活下去而投奔齊國的，十人中就有六人。到了第三年，兩國的國君無計可施，只好向齊國請求歸順臣服。","n":57,"ssz":".........1..............................................."},{"section":"self_challenge","slug":"9uqnf","idx":null,"text":"弈秋，通國之善弈1者也。使弈秋誨二人弈，其一人專心致志，惟弈秋之爲聽；一人雖聽之，一心以爲有鴻鵠將至，思援弓繳2而射之。雖與之俱學，弗若3之矣。爲是其智弗若與？曰：非然也。(91基二)","n":92,"ssz":".....................2.............2.....2.................................................."},{"section":"served:lesson_code","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"文-L12","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:series","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"文言文","n":3,"ssz":"..."},{"section":"served:title","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"不流血的戰爭","n":6,"ssz":"......"},{"section":"served:reading_strategy","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"文言聚光燈：倒裝句","n":9,"ssz":"........."},{"section":"served:intro.background","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"這篇文章講述了春秋時期，齊桓公與他的謀臣管仲之間的一段對話。故事中，管仲提出了一個巧妙的方法，讓齊國能夠在不發動戰爭的情況下，影響並讓鄰近的魯梁兩國臣服。文章描述了管仲如何運用經濟和民俗的力量，逐步瓦解魯梁國家的自給自足能力，進而達到不流血的征服。透過這段歷史記載，我們可以了解當時國家之間的外交策略和經濟手段。","n":156,"ssz":".........................1..............1.................................................1................1.............................1............1....."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[0].name","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"導讀","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[1].name","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"古文今譯","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[2].name","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"原文","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[3].no","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"一","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[3].name","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"文白句子比對","n":6,"ssz":"...1.."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[4].no","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"二","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[4].name","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"文白詞語比對","n":6,"ssz":"......"},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[5].no","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"三","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[5].name","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"文章重點表","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[6].no","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"四","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[6].name","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"文言文聚光燈","n":6,"ssz":"......"},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[6].subtitle","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"賓語前置：倒裝句","n":8,"ssz":"........"},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[7].no","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"五","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[7].name","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"閱讀理解","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[8].no","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"六","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[8].name","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"自我挑戰","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"根據文章，魯梁國君下令全民生產綈，最直接的原因是什麼？","n":27,"ssz":"..........................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"綈的製作簡單","n":6,"ssz":"......"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"齊國高價收購","n":6,"ssz":"......"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"國內糧食不足","n":6,"ssz":"......"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"人民喜歡穿綈","n":6,"ssz":"......"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"根據本文，下列哪一組因果關係正確？","n":17,"ssz":"........2........"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"齊國禁止與魯梁通商，造成綈的需求增加","n":18,"ssz":".................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"魯梁全民生產綈，經濟繁榮也帶動農業發展","n":19,"ssz":"..................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"魯梁荒廢農業，導致糧食不足","n":13,"ssz":"............."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"齊國改穿帛，直接讓魯梁增加獲利。","n":16,"ssz":"................"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"下列哪一現代經濟行為，可能導致與魯梁相同的結果？","n":24,"ssz":"...1..............1....."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"分散生產不同商品，並拓展多個市場","n":16,"ssz":".............1.."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"集中生產單一商品，並依賴單一市場","n":16,"ssz":".....2.......1.."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"改良國內生產技術，提升產品品質","n":15,"ssz":"..............."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"降低對外市場依賴，增加國內需求","n":15,"ssz":"..............."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[3].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"根據本文，下列何者最能說明「經濟戰」的特點？","n":22,"ssz":"......................"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[3].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"購買高價武器，直接攻打","n":11,"ssz":"..........."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[3].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"利用價格與供需控制對方","n":11,"ssz":"..........."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[3].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"依靠外交人才進行談判","n":10,"ssz":".........."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[3].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"利用流行文化，賺別國的錢","n":12,"ssz":"............"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[4].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"孔子到楚國，看見一位捕蟬的老人，一抓一個準。孔子問他有什麼訣竅?他說：「雖天地之大，萬物之多，而唯蟬翼之知。吾不反不側，不以萬物易蟬之翼，何為而不得？」根據老人的話，什麼是他抓蟬率高的原因？","n":95,"ssz":"........1.......2..1.....................................1....................................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[4].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"用心專一，集中精神","n":9,"ssz":"........."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[4].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"蟬的棲息地大，數量也多","n":11,"ssz":"..........."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[4].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"熟能生巧，閉著眼都抓得到","n":12,"ssz":"......4....."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[4].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"了解蟬的習性，抓住翅膀就能手到擒來","n":17,"ssz":"1................"},{"section":"served:text_type","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"單","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.answer_carrier","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"橘色代號與填空（字元樣式 aff6／af）＋ 橘色圈選（roundRect，srgb FF9900）","n":50,"ssz":"......1..........................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"你看過文字在句子裡玩「大風吹、換位子」嗎？在中文裡，有一種神奇的魔法叫做「倒裝句」！\n通常我們說話都有固定的順序，但有時候，為了「強調重點」或「傳達強烈的情感」，會故意把最重要的語詞搬到句子最前面，讓人第一眼就看到這個被強調的焦點，留下深刻的印象！而且，這種換位子的魔法，還能讓句子讀起來更有節奏感呢！\n接下來，請跟著說明，一起認識「賓語前置的倒裝句」。","n":177,"ssz":".......1.........1.........2..................................1...1...........................1.............1..1...................1........1.....................2.............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"你看過文字在句子裡玩「大風吹、換位子」嗎？在中文裡，有一種神奇的魔法叫做「倒裝句」！","n":42,"ssz":".......1.........1.........2.............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"通常我們說話都有固定的順序，但有時候，為了「強調重點」或「傳達強烈的情感」，會故意把最重要的語詞搬到句子最前面，讓人第一眼就看到這個被強調的焦點，留下深刻的印象！而且，這種換位子的魔法，還能讓句子讀起來更有節奏感呢！","n":108,"ssz":"...................1...1...........................1.............1..1...................1........1.........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"接下來，請跟著說明，一起認識「賓語前置的倒裝句」。","n":25,"ssz":"..........2.............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"一、重點攻略","n":6,"ssz":"......"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"國文課本有一課〈愛蓮說〉，作者說他很愛蓮花，但他卻把「愛蓮」寫成「蓮之愛」。來看看這是怎麼回事？","n":48,"ssz":".....1.........................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"正常敘事句結構：(主語) + 述語(動詞) + 賓語           (我)愛蓮","n":42,"ssz":".........................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"賓語前置的倒裝：(主語) + 賓語 + 之(為) + 述語(動詞)    蓮之愛\n是","n":42,"ssz":".........................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"賓語前置的倒裝：(主語) + 賓語 + 之(為) + 述語(動詞)    蓮之愛","n":40,"ssz":"........................................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"是","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[5].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"觀察到了嗎?為了達到倒裝的目的，賓語被移到動詞前面，而且賓語與動詞間還必須加「是」或「之(為)」，讓人知道這是文字「換位子」哦！","n":64,"ssz":"......1.......2.............................................1..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[6].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"可能有同學會問：文言文中，「之」很常見啊，要怎麼判斷句子是不是倒裝了呢?我們可以思考：賓語的詞性應該是什麼?沒錯！就是名詞、代詞。所以，賓語前置的倒裝句的結構應該像下面這樣：","n":87,"ssz":"...........................1.1........................................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[7].columns[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"成分","n":2,"ssz":".1"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[7].columns[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"說明","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[7].instruction","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"賓語提前倒裝句型","n":8,"ssz":"........"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[7].rows[0][0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"(主語)","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[7].rows[0][1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"可省略","n":3,"ssz":"..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[7].rows[1][0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"賓語","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[7].rows[1][1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"名/代詞","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[7].rows[2][0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"是/之","n":3,"ssz":"..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[7].rows[2][1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"助詞","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[7].rows[3][0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"述語","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[7].rows[3][1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"動詞","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[8].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"另一種常見的形式是：","n":10,"ssz":".2........"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[9].rows[0][0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"唯","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[9].rows[0][1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"副詞","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[10].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"寫成「唯……是……」。「唯」意思是「只」，用來限定動詞的範圍，「是」是表示賓語前置了。","n":43,"ssz":"...............2..........................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[11].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"比如「只吃肉」，動詞是「吃」，吃肉，加了「只」就可以讓人知道限定吃肉，在「肉的範圍內都吃，其他的都不吃」。","n":53,"ssz":"....................................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[12].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"「只吃肉」是正常的敘事句，古文用語寫成「唯吃肉」，按照文字大風吹的規則：動詞跟賓語要換位子；賓語(肉)前置，動詞(吃)被擠到後面，賓語跟動詞中間要放助詞(是)讓人知道這是倒裝句。剩下的語詞(唯)位子不動，「唯吃肉」就會變成「唯肉是吃」了。","n":119,"ssz":"............................................1.....................................................11..................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[13].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"現在，你已經了解賓語前置倒裝句的魔法了，但我們還需要進一步地熟悉「怎麼還原」?這將有助於我們快速地理解句意哦！具體步驟如下：","n":62,"ssz":"......1....................1.......1............1............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[14].instruction","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"還原賓語前置倒裝句","n":9,"ssz":"1........"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[14].columns[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"步驟","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[14].columns[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"句子1","n":3,"ssz":".1."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[14].columns[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"句子2","n":3,"ssz":".1."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[14].rows[0][0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"倒裝句","n":3,"ssz":"..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[14].rows[0][1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"牡 丹 之 愛","n":7,"ssz":"......."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[14].rows[0][2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"唯 利 是 圖","n":7,"ssz":"......."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[14].rows[1][0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"1.去助詞","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[14].rows[2][0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"2.助詞前後的賓語、動詞換位子","n":15,"ssz":"..............1"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[14].rows[2][1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"愛  牡丹","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[14].rows[2][2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"圖  利","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[14].rows[3][0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"3.有副詞就補(虛線表示)","n":13,"ssz":"............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[14].rows[3][2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"唯 圖 利","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[14].rows[4][0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"4.理解句意","n":6,"ssz":"......"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[14].rows[4][1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"愛牡丹","n":3,"ssz":"..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[14].rows[4][2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"只 貪圖 利益","n":7,"ssz":"......."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[15].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"透過以上的說明，你是否對還原「賓語前置的倒裝句」更有信心了呢?\n你想挑戰看看：自己解開語序顛倒的文字密碼嗎？以下的題目，請務必嘗試看看。","n":68,"ssz":"............1.................................1....................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[15].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"透過以上的說明，你是否對還原「賓語前置的倒裝句」更有信心了呢?","n":31,"ssz":"............1.................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[15].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"你想挑戰看看：自己解開語序顛倒的文字密碼嗎？以下的題目，請務必嘗試看看。","n":36,"ssz":"..............1....................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[16].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"二、輕練習","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[17].instruction","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"(一)選一選。下列都是倒裝句，請選出還原後的句子。","n":25,"ssz":"..................1....1."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[17].items[0].stem","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"「何陋之有」 A陋何有 / B有何陋","n":18,"ssz":".................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[17].items[1].stem","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"「馬首是瞻」 A馬瞻首 / B瞻馬首","n":18,"ssz":".................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[17].items[2].stem","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"「何難之有」 A有何難 / B何難有","n":18,"ssz":".................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[17].items[3].stem","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"「唯你是問」 A問唯你 / B唯問你","n":18,"ssz":".................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[17].items[4].stem","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"「何懼之有」 A有何懼 / B何有懼","n":18,"ssz":".................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[17].items[5].stem","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"「唯利是圖」 A 圖唯利/ B唯圖利","n":18,"ssz":".................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[17].teacher_note_carrier","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"深藍色（C:156082）文字方塊，印在題目右側；第 3、5 題沒有解析","n":36,"ssz":"...................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[18].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"(二)寫一寫。先還原倒裝句，再依還原句及語境圈出適當的意思解釋。","n":32,"ssz":"........1.......1........1..2..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[19].label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"寫一寫 1","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[19].value","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"1.韓愈說他很小的時候就失去父母，對父母沒有印象，「唯兄嫂是依」。\n「唯兄嫂是依」句子還原 → 唯【　】\n意思：只能【　】哥哥、嫂嫂生活。","n":69,"ssz":"..........................................11..........2.......1..1..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[19].value#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"1.韓愈說他很小的時候就失去父母，對父母沒有印象，「唯兄嫂是依」。","n":33,"ssz":"................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[19].value#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"「唯兄嫂是依」句子還原 → 唯【　】","n":18,"ssz":"........11........"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[19].value#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"意思：只能【　】哥哥、嫂嫂生活。","n":16,"ssz":".2.......1..1..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[19].blanks[0].answer","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"依兄嫂","n":3,"ssz":"..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[19].blanks[1].answer","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"依靠","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[19].options_printed.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"依然","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[19].answer_carrier","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"還原句是橘色手寫（字元樣式 aff6）；意思那一格是**橘色圈選**（roundRect FF9900，0.48×0.33in）圈住「依靠」","n":70,"ssz":"1....................2................................................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[20].label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"寫一寫 2","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[20].value","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"2.孔子說：當父母的人「唯其疾之憂」。所以，子女愛護身體，不生病，就是孝順。\n「唯其疾之憂」句子還原 →【　】\n意思：唯一【　】的是孩子生病。","n":71,"ssz":"...............................................11........2.........1..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[20].value#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"2.孔子說：當父母的人「唯其疾之憂」。所以，子女愛護身體，不生病，就是孝順。","